{"parentUuid":"6b27d0ec-ea29-451d-9670-76830adb8379","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_fc88df41cba143cea89f8131","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_185af1f6fc714134ba047689","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/warner/openvela/docs/zh-cn/quickstart/openvela_ubuntu_quick_start.md","limit":100,"offset":150}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":2084,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":33216,"output_tokens":74,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"861585f1-de34-4468-bec1-a2b7ace8533b","timestamp":"2026-08-20T09:18:36.135Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"4e5d5a04-986e-4343-ae7e-1f641f6267d8","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"861585f1-de34-4468-bec1-a2b7ace8533b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2a8eeb49-4773-4916-8fe1-4e2a8a39eaf2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_185af1f6fc714134ba047689","type":"tool_result","content":"150\t    > - 首次同步耗时较长，具体时间取决于您的网络状况和磁盘性能。\n151\t    > - 若因网络问题中断，可重复执行 `repo sync` 进行增量同步。\n152\t\n153\t## 步骤三：编译源代码\n154\t\n155\t完成源代码下载后，请在 openvela 根目录下执行以下编译步骤。\n156\t\n157\t### 1. （可选）自定义内核配置\n158\t\n159\t您可以通过 `menuconfig` 命令打开图形化界面，以调整 NuttX 内核与组件的配置。\n160\t\n161\t```Bash\n162\t./build.sh vendor/openvela/boards/vela/configs/goldfish-arm64-v8a-ap/ --cmake menuconfig\n163\t```\n164\t\n165\t> **操作技巧**\n166\t>\n167\t> - 按 `/` 键可搜索配置项。\n168\t> - 按 `空格键` 可切换选中状态（启用/禁用/模块化）。\n169\t> - 配置完成后，选择 **Save** 保存并退出。\n170\t\n171\t<img src=\"./figures/006.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75%\">\n172\t\n173\t### 2. 执行编译\n174\t\n175\t执行以下命令，构建整个项目。\n176\t\n177\t```Bash\n178\t./build.sh vendor/openvela/boards/vela/configs/goldfish-arm64-v8a-ap/ --cmake -j$(nproc)\n179\t```\n180\t\n181\t编译成功后，您将在 `cmake_out/vela_goldfish-arm64-v8a-ap` 目录下找到 `nuttx` 等编译产物。\n182\t\n183\t<img src=\"./figures/007.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75%\">\n184\t\n185\t## 步骤四：运行模拟器\n186\t\n187\t在 openvela 根目录下，执行以下脚本启动 `Vela Emulator` 并加载您的编译产物。\n188\t\n189\t```Bash\n190\t./emulator.sh cmake_out/vela_goldfish-arm64-v8a-ap/\n191\t```\n192\t\n193\t模拟器启动后，您将看到 `goldfish-armv8a-ap>` 提示符，表明 openvela 已成功运行。\n194\t\n195\t<img src=\"./figures/008.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75%\">\n196\t\n197\t## 后续步骤\n198\t\n199\t- 常见问题\n200\t\n201\t    - [快速入门常见问题](../faq/QuickStart_FAQ.md)\n202\t    - [开发者常见问题解答](../faq/devoloper_tech_faq.md)\n203\t\n204\t- 进一步阅读\n205\t\n206\t    - [使用模拟器调试](./emulator/Debugging_Vela_with_Vela_Emulator_zh-cn.md)\n207\t    - [ADB 命令](./emulator/Android_Debug_Bridge_commands_zh-cn.md)\n208\t    - [发送模拟器控制台命令](./emulator/Send_emulator_console_commands_zh-cn.md)\n209\t"}]},"uuid":"b92bff7a-2dc7-4f72-911e-601b581e344c","timestamp":"2026-08-20T09:18:36.142Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/warner/openvela/docs/zh-cn/quickstart/openvela_ubuntu_quick_start.md","content":"    > - 首次同步耗时较长，具体时间取决于您的网络状况和磁盘性能。\n    > - 若因网络问题中断，可重复执行 `repo sync` 进行增量同步。\n\n## 步骤三：编译源代码\n\n完成源代码下载后，请在 openvela 根目录下执行以下编译步骤。\n\n### 1. （可选）自定义内核配置\n\n您可以通过 `menuconfig` 命令打开图形化界面，以调整 NuttX 内核与组件的配置。\n\n```Bash\n./build.sh vendor/openvela/boards/vela/configs/goldfish-arm64-v8a-ap/ --cmake menuconfig\n```\n\n> **操作技巧**\n>\n> - 按 `/` 键可搜索配置项。\n> - 按 `空格键` 可切换选中状态（启用/禁用/模块化）。\n> - 配置完成后，选择 **Save** 保存并退出。\n\n<img src=\"./figures/006.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75%\">\n\n### 2. 执行编译\n\n执行以下命令，构建整个项目。\n\n```Bash\n./build.sh vendor/openvela/boards/vela/configs/goldfish-arm64-v8a-ap/ --cmake -j$(nproc)\n```\n\n编译成功后，您将在 `cmake_out/vela_goldfish-arm64-v8a-ap` 目录下找到 `nuttx` 等编译产物。\n\n<img src=\"./figures/007.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75%\">\n\n## 步骤四：运行模拟器\n\n在 openvela 根目录下，执行以下脚本启动 `Vela Emulator` 并加载您的编译产物。\n\n```Bash\n./emulator.sh cmake_out/vela_goldfish-arm64-v8a-ap/\n```\n\n模拟器启动后，您将看到 `goldfish-armv8a-ap>` 提示符，表明 openvela 已成功运行。\n\n<img src=\"./figures/008.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75%\">\n\n## 后续步骤\n\n- 常见问题\n\n    - [快速入门常见问题](../faq/QuickStart_FAQ.md)\n    - [开发者常见问题解答](../faq/devoloper_tech_faq.md)\n\n- 进一步阅读\n\n    - [使用模拟器调试](./emulator/Debugging_Vela_with_Vela_Emulator_zh-cn.md)\n    - [ADB 命令](./emulator/Android_Debug_Bridge_commands_zh-cn.md)\n    - [发送模拟器控制台命令](./emulator/Send_emulator_console_commands_zh-cn.md)\n","numLines":60,"startLine":150,"totalLines":209}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1f969624-e92d-462c-98df-1f8255b93f9c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"4e5d5a04-986e-4343-ae7e-1f641f6267d8","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
