{"parentUuid":"94ce0fc4-8d8e-4a45-90ff-5b253260a0d9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2a8eeb49-4773-4916-8fe1-4e2a8a39eaf2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_fd1f17083f2443d3a11b1072","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t==========\n2\tST STM32N6\n3\t==========\n4\t\n5\tThis is a port of NuttX to the STM32N6 family.\n6\tThe STM32N6 is a chip based on the Arm Cortex-M55.\n7\t\n8\tDevelopment is performed on the Nucleo-N657X0-Q.  At this time only the\n9\tSTM32N657X0 is supported.  Kconfig will need updates to support other\n10\tMCUs in the family.\n11\t\n12\tSupported MCUs\n13\t==============\n14\t\n15\t===========  ======= ================\n16\tMCU          Support Note\n17\t===========  ======= ================\n18\tSTM32N645     No\n19\tSTM32N647     No\n20\tSTM32N655     No\n21\tSTM32N657     Yes    STM32N657X0 only\n22\t===========  ======= ================\n23\t\n24\tPeripheral Support\n25\t==================\n26\t\n27\tThe following list indicates peripherals supported in NuttX:\n28\t\n29\t==========  =======  ===============================================\n30\tPeripheral  Support  Notes\n31\t==========  =======  ===============================================\n32\tGPIO        Yes\n33\tPWR         Yes      Partial.\n34\tRCC         Yes      PLL1 clock tree.\n35\tUSART       Yes      USART1 only.\n36\t\n37\tADC         No\n38\tDCACHE      No\n39\tDCMIPP      No\n40\tDMA         No\n41\tETH         No\n42\tI2C         No\n43\tICACHE      No\n44\tIWDG        No\n45\tLPTIM       No\n46\tLTDC        No\n47\tMPU         No\n48\tNPU         No\n49\tRNG         No\n50\tRTC         No\n51\tSAI         No\n52\tSDMMC       No\n53\tSPI         No\n54\tTIM         No\n55\tUSB         No\n56\tXSPI        No\n57\t==========  =======  ===============================================\n58\t\n59\tReferences\n60\t==========\n61\t\n62\t[RM0486] STMicroelectronics, STM32N647/657xx Arm®-based 32-bit MCUs\n63\t\n64\tSupported Boards\n65\t================\n66\t\n67\t.. toctree::\n68\t   :glob:\n69\t   :maxdepth: 1\n70\t\n71\t   boards/*/*\n72\t"}]},"uuid":"093e570b-abb5-47a4-aff6-56e62e5cf52c","timestamp":"2026-08-20T09:19:45.295Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/warner/openvela/nuttx/Documentation/platforms/arm/stm32n6/index.rst","content":"==========\nST STM32N6\n==========\n\nThis is a port of NuttX to the STM32N6 family.\nThe STM32N6 is a chip based on the Arm Cortex-M55.\n\nDevelopment is performed on the Nucleo-N657X0-Q.  At this time only the\nSTM32N657X0 is supported.  Kconfig will need updates to support other\nMCUs in the family.\n\nSupported MCUs\n==============\n\n===========  ======= ================\nMCU          Support Note\n===========  ======= ================\nSTM32N645     No\nSTM32N647     No\nSTM32N655     No\nSTM32N657     Yes    STM32N657X0 only\n===========  ======= ================\n\nPeripheral Support\n==================\n\nThe following list indicates peripherals supported in NuttX:\n\n==========  =======  ===============================================\nPeripheral  Support  Notes\n==========  =======  ===============================================\nGPIO        Yes\nPWR         Yes      Partial.\nRCC         Yes      PLL1 clock tree.\nUSART       Yes      USART1 only.\n\nADC         No\nDCACHE      No\nDCMIPP      No\nDMA         No\nETH         No\nI2C         No\nICACHE      No\nIWDG        No\nLPTIM       No\nLTDC        No\nMPU         No\nNPU         No\nRNG         No\nRTC         No\nSAI         No\nSDMMC       No\nSPI         No\nTIM         No\nUSB         No\nXSPI        No\n==========  =======  ===============================================\n\nReferences\n==========\n\n[RM0486] STMicroelectronics, STM32N647/657xx Arm®-based 32-bit MCUs\n\nSupported Boards\n================\n\n.. toctree::\n   :glob:\n   :maxdepth: 1\n\n   boards/*/*\n","numLines":72,"startLine":1,"totalLines":72}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5267cb0a-542e-42cb-8e2b-3a8e1ff8c7c8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"4e5d5a04-986e-4343-ae7e-1f641f6267d8","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
